      "algolia_solution": "Algolia Dynamic Faceting surfaces the most relevant filters for each query context. Searching 'backpacks' shows Capacity, Trip Duration, and Activity filters. Searching 'jackets' shows Insulation Type, Weather Rating, and Activity filters. Algolia Personalization feeds XPLR Pass behavioral signals into result ranking in real time.",
